        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Daltoni, Dalton Gang\n- Places: Niš, Coffeyville, Kansas\n- People: Grat Dalton\n- Topics: former Yugoslav rock scene, American Old West\n\nFacts:\n- Daltoni was a Serbian and former Yugoslav rock band from Niš.\n- Daltoni was notable as one of the pioneers of the former Yugoslav rock scene.\n- The Dalton Gang was a group of outlaws in the American Old West during 1890–1892.\n- Grat Dalton was the leader of the Dalton Gang.\n- Grat Dalton died during an ill-fated bank raid in Coffeyville, Kansas.",
